{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2TI","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"提摩太后书","commonName":"提摩太后书","title":"提摩太后书","order":55,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"2419cce63d8d9b20b2766a3e5566e10d9a2432d2d4b8e1dc4f6d42a4bf34c8dc","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2TI/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":83},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["末世的人性"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你该知道，末世必有危险的日子来到。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因为那时，人要专顾自己，贪爱钱财，自夸，狂傲，谤 ，违背父母，忘恩负义，心不圣洁，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["无亲情，不解怨，好说谗言，不能自约，性情凶暴，不爱良善，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["卖主卖友，任意妄为，自高自大，爱宴乐，不爱 神，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["有敬虔的外貌，却背了敬虔的实意；这等人你要躲开。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那偷进人家、牢笼无知妇女的，正是这等人。这些妇女担负罪恶，被各样的私欲引诱，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["常常学习，终久不能明白真道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["从前雅尼和佯庇怎样敌挡摩西，这等人也怎样敌挡真道。他们的心地坏了，在真道上是可废弃的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["然而他们不能再这样敌挡；因为他们的愚昧必在众人面前显露出来，像那二人一样。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["对提摩太的最后指示"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["但你已经服从了我的教训、品行、志向、信心、宽容、爱心、忍耐，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["以及我在安提阿、以哥念、路司得所遭遇的逼迫、苦难。我所忍受是何等的逼迫；但从这一切苦难中，主都把我救出来了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["不但如此，凡立志在基督耶稣里敬虔度日的也都要受逼迫。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["只是作恶的和迷惑人的，必越久越恶，他欺哄人，也被人欺哄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["但你所学习的，所确信的，要存在心里；因为你知道是跟谁学的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["并且知道你是从小明白圣经，这圣经能使你因信基督耶稣，有得救的智慧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["圣经都是 神所默示的",{"noteId":1},"，于教训、督责、使人归正、教导人学义都是有益的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["叫属 神的人得以完全，预备行各样的善事。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"或译：凡 神所默示的圣经","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2TI/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2TI/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2TI/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}